  "bodyHash": "4+y18a6Emv4=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这是本模组的 <strong>Forge</strong> 版本！Fabric 版本请在此处获取：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric</a></span></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3>可自定义玩家模型</h3><p>使用编辑器创建自定义角色形象。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/337/167/2021-01-30_12.png\" alt=\"在编辑器中创建帽子\" width=\"960\" height=\"509\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模型需要导出后才能在世界中显示。<a href=\"https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/wiki/Exporting\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/wiki/Exporting</a></span><br>模型会存储在您 Minecraft 皮肤文件的未使用空间内，或作为 GitHub 上的 Gist 存储。</p><p>将导出的图像文件上传为您的皮肤以加载自定义模型。</p><p>在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcpmmodels.tom5454.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模型网站</a>上浏览已上传的模型。&nbsp;</p><p>附加部件可拥有自定义纹理，可使用更高分辨率的皮肤<span style=\"font-size:10px\">（Steve 皮肤来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-vanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soartex Fanver - Vanilla</a>）</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></p><p>可隐藏或移动普通玩家模型的各个部分。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/337/171/cpm_examples.png\" alt=\"示例\" width=\"960\" height=\"509\"></p><p>您甚至可以让皮肤的部分区域像发光鱿鱼一样“发光”。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/337/173/2021-01-30_12.png\" alt=\"发光效果\" width=\"320\" height=\"272\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Discord 服务器：</span><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:Whitney, &amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:rgba(4, 4, 5, 0.07)\" href=\"https://discord.gg/mKyXdEsMZD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>https://discord.gg/mKyXdEsMZD</strong></span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">用于在游戏中更换皮肤的 Bukkit/Spigot 服务器插件（非必需）：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/bukkit-plugins/custom-player-models-bukkit\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/bukkit-plugins/custom-player-models-bukkit</a></span></p><h3>按 Minecraft 版本与加载器版本下载：</h3><p>1.21.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.6 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.6&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.6&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.6&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a><br>1.20.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a><br>1.19.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.19.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.19.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.3 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.19.3&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.19.3&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.19.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.19.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.18.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.18.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.18.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.17.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.17.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.17.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.16.5 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.16.5&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.16.5&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.15.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.15.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.15.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.14.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.14.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.14.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.12.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.12.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.10.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.10.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.8.9 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.8.9&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.7.10 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.7.10&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.6.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.6.4&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.5.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.5.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.4.7 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.4.7&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.2.5 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.2.5&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></p><p>Beta 1.7.3 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=Beta 1.7.3&amp;gameVersionTypeId=17\" rel=\"nofollow\">Babric 与 Better Than Adventure</a></p>",
